{"kind": "mod", "id": 2344, "name": "Dynamic Item Weights", "slug": "dynamic-item-weights", "teaser": "Say bye to the empty 9kg jerry can! This simple mod adjusts the weight of items based on their current usage.", "owner_name": "Tosox", "downloads": 10225, "favourites": 31, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": "de.tosox.dynamicitemweights", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Items", "category_id": 4, "updated_at": "2026-08-04T15:17:06.000000Z", "created_at": "2025-10-08T19:20:55.000000Z", "published_at": "2025-10-08T20:06:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.0.0", "latest_version": "1.1.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<h2>📜 Description</h2>\n<p><strong>Dynamic Item Weights</strong> is a mod for <em>Single Player Tarkov</em> that adjusts the weight of items based on their current usage.</p>\n<hr />\n<h2>📁 Installation</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Download the latest release</li>\n<li>Copy the <code>BepInEx</code> folder into your SPT folder</li>\n<li>Start the game</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h2>📷 Preview</h2>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://github.com/Tosox/SPT-DynamicItemWeights/blob/master/readme-res/fuel_full.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://github.com/Tosox/SPT-DynamicItemWeights/blob/master/readme-res/fuel_used.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n<hr />\n<h2>🛠️ Configuration</h2>\n<h3>In-game menu</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Enable Plugin</strong>: Toggle dynamic item weights on/off</li>\n<li><strong>Default Empty Fraction</strong>: Fallback empty weight as a fraction of the full item weight</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>emptyweights.json</h3>\n<p>A JSON file mapping the item template ID to the empty weight in kilograms</p>\n<pre><code>{\n    \"57513f07245977207e26a311\": 0.030, // Apple\n    \"5d1b36a186f7742523398433\": 2.500  // Fuel (Metal)\n}\n</code></pre>\n<blockquote>\n<p>If an item is missing, the plugin uses <code>Default Empty Fraction</code> of the original weight</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr />\n<h2>📄 License</h2>\n<p>Distributed under the MIT License. See <code>LICENSE</code> for more information.</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 795, "published_at": "2025-10-08T20:01:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2344/dynamic-item-weights/1.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.1.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.0", "content_length": 5807, "downloads": 9430, "published_at": "2025-10-14T22:18:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2344/dynamic-item-weights/1.1.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": []}], "repos": ["Tosox/SPT-DynamicItemWeights"], "source_code_links": [{"url": "https://github.com/Tosox/SPT-DynamicItemWeights", "label": ""}], "required_by": 0, "no_repo": false, "obtainable": true, "dep_problems": 0}